title: Ministry of Territory
new-page: true
view-if: generalitat_territory_timer <= 0 and (territory_minister_party == player_party)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; generalitat_territory_timer += 3;
is-card: true
card-image: img/territory_icon.svg
frequency: 100
tags: generalitat
go-to: territory_choices
role: card-gov

@territory_choices
new-page: true
# face-image: img/territory_icon.svg

= Ministry of Territory

The Minsitry of the Territory handles all Generalitat-operated infrastructure, from railways to highways and ports, as well as having dedicated Departments for the primary sector, urban planning, housing, etc.

- @state
- @urban_development
- @agriculture
- @infrastructure
- @post_event: We don't want to do anything in this ministry at the moment
- @easy_discard

